      "desc:8": "A hive is more than a pile of bugs. Know what you are shooting at:\n\n- §6Glyphid§r - the common worker.\n- §6Brawler§r and §6Behemoth§r - bigger, tougher and harder hitting. A Behemoth sprays sulfuric acid and leaves an acid cloud when it dies.\n- §6Bombardier§r and §6Blaster§r - stay back and lob acid bombs.\n- §6Digger§r - tunnels through any block weaker than concrete, so dirt walls will not stop a swarm.\n- §6Scout§r - wanders off to find a spot for a §cnew hive§r. Kill scouts on sight.\n- §6Brenda§r - releases a cloud of pheromones and a brood of glyphids when it dies.\n- §6Big Man Johnson§r - carries a nuclear payload and blows up on death, spilling parasitic maggots.\n\nGlyphids can also be tamed: feed one §6Grilled Glyphid Meat§r and with luck it becomes your pet. Right click to make it sit, feed it meat to heal it. Infected glyphids cannot be tamed.",
